    [FIX] Stop four kinds of collection failures; count overlaps apart from warnings
    
    - a coach the source leaves blank ({"name": ""}) refused the whole line-up (97 matches);
    - a line-up not published yet (no player) is unavailable, asked again at kick-off;
    - the halves of extra time in the team statistics refused the match (17);
    - a player profile the plan in use does not hold (403 PLAN_UPGRADE_REQUIRED, 1,949
      players retried every day) is unavailable, asked again in 30 days;
    - a match still not started hours after its kick-off, that no watch follows, is asked
      once a day: a new date restarts its watch, the same one notes it as never final.
    The status read counts the matches two sources hold (4,460) as overlaps, not warnings,
    and plan-limited profiles as unavailable calls.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

